# Upstream pin, carried as a source tarball rather than fetched at image-build
# time: the checks must not depend on a live network, and a slow mirror must not
# be counted as a candidate failure.  Regenerate with
#   git -C <checkout> archive --format=tar <sha> | gzip -n -9 > pin.tar.gz
#
# AviSynth+ publishes tagged releases, but the newest (v3.7.5, 2025-04-21)
# predates four of this ladder's families -- it carries 56 of the 80 `intel/`
# files and is missing every file of the overlay masked-rowprep, layer,
# turn-avx2, planeswap-avx2 and getalpharect sets.  A commit SHA at a stated
# date is the legitimate pin in that case, so the base is `master` at the last
# commit that touched any of the files the ladder names.
